\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Unto God shall I be singing,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0  Ever glad and thankful be;
\par  In His plan for souls' salvation,
\par  Clearly I His goodness see;
\par  It is naught but loving kindness
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  Which His gracious heart  doth move.
\par  Endless it confirms to prove,
\par  God will bless all who see clearly,
\par  Earthly things shall pass away,
\par  God's love will forever stay.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  God's own Son, a gift most precious,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0  Yet to mankind goodness see;
\par  From eternal pain and torment,
\par  Saved my soul, His blood was spent.
\par  O, Thou fount of depth and beauty,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par How can I, with human mind,
\par  Fathom why Thou art so kind,
\par  Though I search with zealous duty
\par  Earthly things shall pass away,
\par  God's love will forever stay!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par       3.  Holy Spirit faithful Leader,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0        Granted to me by rebirth.
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0      Be my constant guide and ruler,
\par      Both in heav'n and here on earth.
\par      O, may Thou my heart be filling,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par     With Thy radiant truth and light;
\par      Vanquish death and all its might,
\par      All its power and mis'ry stilling.
\par      Earthly things shall pass away,
\par      God's love will forever stay.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Lord, I know Thy love isendless,
\par      Boundless too, Thy mercy mild;
\par       Thus I plead, hands to Thee raising;
\par      Gracious Father, hear Thy child!
\par      Please, extend to me Thy favour;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par      Grant new strength and grace, I pray!
\par      Be Thou near me night and day,
\par      In Thy presence dwell forever,
\par      Praise And honour all are Thine,
\par      Now and ever Lord divine.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

